<sect1 id="compare_floats_8h_1motivation">
<title>Motivation</title><para>Record run configuration and parameters for later use to steer the simulation as it runs. <linebreak/>
</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_two_phase_implicit_node_centered_f_v_transport_1design">
<title>Design Intent</title><para>To have everything that concerns the time-stepping control for a run in a single object. <linebreak/>
</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_visitor_1applicability">
<title>Applicability</title><para>Any CSMP model.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_two_phase_implicit_node_centered_f_v_transport_1consequences">
<title>Consequences</title><para>You can inherit from this baseclass.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_visitor_1examples">
<title>Application Examples</title><para>Set the object up from an input file and use it to control the time stepping and output of data from a run: <linebreak/>
</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">ComputationalSettings<sp/><sp/>run_settings;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>duration(run_settings.Duration());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>time_until_output<sp/>=<sp/>run_settings.NearestOutputTime(<sp/>model_time<sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(<sp/>run_settings.IsOutputTime(<sp/>model_time,<sp/>1.<sp/>)<sp/><sp/>)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</sect1>
